sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Agent
    participant LLM
    participant Tool as Search Tool

    User->>Agent: What's the weather in Paris?
    Agent->>LLM: Prompt + tool definitions
    LLM-->>Agent: tool_call: search("Paris weather")
    Agent->>Tool: search("Paris weather")
    Tool-->>Agent: 18°C, partly cloudy
    Agent->>LLM: Tool result
    LLM-->>Agent: "It's 18°C and partly cloudy in Paris."
    Agent-->>User: Final answer
